  // Absolute local JSON file path
  outputPath: string;
  // Absolute local JSON file path
  path: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Import STEP/STP with real OCCT unit normalization to mm, or outward closed convex STL with explicit scaleToMm, and publish a new project JSON. Preserves source bytes and CAD face mappings. Never replaces source or an existing output.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
