  outputPath: string;
  // Absolute local JSON file path
  path: string;
  requestId: string;
  size?: number;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Read and validate a v1 case/view or v2 case/view/measurement bundle, using existing saved-result validation, exact restored-result links and compatible display settings. Recompute all v2 recorded measurements against saved fields; this does not certify physical accuracy. Returns only counts, revision and compact matching metadata; never physical arrays or complete archives.

